<title>USA: U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said the 23.973 million bushels of wheat, 35.153 million of corn and no barley inspected for export in the week ended Oct 24 were for the following shipment from port areas or inland inspection points (1,000 bu).</p>
<p>	     Wheat     Corn	Barley</p>
<p> Lakes     4,139	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Atlantic    Nil    1,398	  Nil</p>
<p> Gulf     11,923   23,457	  Nil</p>
<p> Pacific   7,342    8,679	  Nil</p>
<p> Interior    569    1,538	  Nil</p>
</text>
